  <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p><em>Nestyroo · AppricotAds LTD · Last updated: 30 October 2026</em></p>

<h2 id="about-this-privacy-policy">1. About this Privacy Policy</h2>
<p>Nestyroo (&quot;Nestyroo&quot;, &quot;we&quot;, &quot;us&quot; or &quot;our&quot;) is an informational website operated by AppricotAds LTD, a company registered in Bulgaria.</p>
<p>Company: AppricotAds LTD</p>
